---
description: Android layered architecture — UI, presentation, domain, data, infrastructure; repositories as data entry points.
alwaysApply: false
globs:
  - "**/domain/**/*.kt"
  - "**/data/**/*.kt"
  - "**/*Repository.kt"
  - "**/di/**/*.kt"
  - "**/*Module.kt"
  - "**/*.gradle.kts"
  - "**/AndroidManifest.xml"
---

# Architecture

- UI → ViewModel → domain (use cases) → data (repositories) → sources.
- Repositories are the only entry to remote/local data from domain or presentation.
- Do not replace an existing project architecture without an integration analysis.
